# pages.manifest — deliberate NEW documentation pages
# =====================================================
# render_docs.sh updates pages whose basename already exists in docs/src.
# A rendered notebook with NO existing page is created only if listed here:
#
#   <basename>.md [subdir-under-docs/src]
#
# One entry per line; the optional second field is the target subdirectory
# under docs/src (default: docs/src itself). Lines starting with # are
# comments. Remember to also add the page to the nav in docs/make.jl.
#
# Phase 7: off-axis projection internals (camera basis, deposit kernels, kinematics)
offaxis_internals.md
# Phase 8: getting-started track
switching_to_mera.md
julia_for_simulation_analysis.md
